   "claims": [
    "Keep reading to learn: The definition of aspect ratio is; How to calculate aspect ratio; What is screen size; How to calculate screen size; and How to calculate 16:9 aspect ratio.",
    "Divide the height by the width, e.g., 1200 / 1600 = 0.75 This is the aspect ratio expressed as a decimal.",
    "Then, the aspect ratio is going to be given as: AR = 2560/1440 = (16 × 160)/(9 × 160) = 16/9 Therefore, we obtain the famous 16:9 aspect ratio.",
    "Compare the result with the popular aspect ratios, e.g., 16:9, to determine which standard your screen follows.",
    "To make sure you'll get a screen with an aspect ratio of 16:9: If you know the screen's height, multiply it by 16/9 to get the necessary width."
